cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  This citation is required under the terms of the Apache 2.0 License
  accompanying this software.

title: "Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 OBIA Crop Type Mapping Pipeline"
version: "2.5.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AIML4OS/WP7-Crop-type-mapping"
url: "https://github.com/AIML4OS/WP7-Crop-type-mapping"

abstract: >-
  An automated, cloud-optimized object-based image analysis (OBIA) pipeline
  designed to process Sentinel-1 SAR and Sentinel-2 optical time series for
  large-scale, national crop type classification. Developed within the AIML4OS
  project (One Stop Shop for Artificial Intelligence in Official Statistics),
  funded by Eurostat, European Commission. Features multimodal feature fusion
  combining NASA Harvest Presto transformer embeddings, PyTorch Deep MLP,
  and XGBoost GBDT with Bayesian prior calibration and multi-orbit nationwide merging.

