      - name: "et al."
    journal: "arXiv preprint"
    year: 2023
    doi: "10.48550/arXiv.2304.14065"
    url: "https://github.com/nasaharvest/presto"
    notes: >-
      Geospatial foundation model providing multi-temporal 128-dimensional
