    license: "BSD-3-Clause"
    url: "https://geopandas.org"
    notes: >-
      Used for reading and processing NUTS2 shapefiles and cadastral parcel geometries.

  # --- Scientific Python Stack ---
  - type: article
    title: "Array Programming with NumPy"
